---
layout: base.njk
title: Masonville Corner Store
description: Cheapest gas in Shelburne, diesel, propane, and friendly neighbourhood service at Masonville Corner Store.
---

<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="hero__content">
    <span class="pill">Open Daily for Fuel & Essentials</span>
    <h1 class="hero__headline">High Quality Fuel, Unbeatable Prices</h1>
    <p class="hero__copy">Your family-run stop for gas, diesel, propane, and everyday essentials. Masonville Corner Store keeps Shelburne moving with friendly service and the best prices in town.</p>
    <div class="hero__ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="{{ store.directionsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ store.cta.directionsLabel }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="tel:{{ store.cta.orderPhone | tel }}">Check Hours</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__media">
    {% image "store_front.jpg", "Masonville Corner Store gas pumps", "(min-width: 960px) 400px, 85vw", "eager", "high" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section services" id="services">
  <header class="section__header">
    <span class="pill">Full Service</span>
    <h2>Fuel up and get back on the road</h2>
    <p>We pride ourselves on offering the most competitive fuel prices in Shelburne, along with all the automotive essentials.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="grid grid--cols-3 services__grid animate-grid">
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Regular & Premium Gas</h3>
      <p>High-quality fuel for every vehicle type at prices that help you save on every tank.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Clear Diesel</h3>
      <p>Reliable diesel fuel for trucks and heavy equipment, always available.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Auto Propane</h3>
      <p>Full-service propane fills for your vehicle or tank exchange for your BBQ.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Convenience Store</h3>
      <p>Snacks, drinks, lotto, and last-minute grocery items to keep you stocked up.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Firewood & Ice</h3>
      <p>Camping or hosting? Grab bags of ice and bundles of firewood on your way through.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Clean Restrooms</h3>
      <p>A tidy, well-maintained stop for you and your family during your road trip.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section highlights" id="menu">
  <header class="section__header">
    <span class="pill">Seasonal Favorites</span>
    <h2>Famous Fresh-Cut Fries</h2>
    <p>When the weather is good, our chip truck serves up the best poutine in the county. <span class="seasonal-tag">Available seasonally.</span></p>
  </header>
  <div class="highlights__grid animate-grid">
    {% for item in menu.featured %}
    <article class="highlight-card">
      <div class="highlight-card__media">
        {% image item.image, item.name, "(min-width: 720px) 300px, 85vw" %}
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-card__body">
        <h3>{{ item.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ item.description }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="text-center mt-4">
    <p class="text-small"><em>Chip truck hours vary by season and weather. Call ahead to confirm availability.</em></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section story" id="story">
  <div class="story__inner">
    <div class="story__copy">
      <span class="pill">Our story</span>
      <h2>Local roots. Loyal neighbours. Best Value.</h2>
      <p>What started as a small-town general store has evolved into Shelburne's go-to spot for fair fuel prices and friendly faces. We believe that filling up your tank shouldn't empty your wallet.</p>
      <p>We're more than just a gas station; we're a community hub where regulars are greeted by name. Whether you're a local resident or just passing through Dufferin County, we treat you like family.</p>
      <ul class="story__highlights">
        {% for highlight in store.highlights %}
        <li>{{ highlight }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="story__media">
      {% image "foodstand-4.jpg", "Masonville Corner Store chip truck", "(min-width: 960px) 400px, 85vw" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reviews" id="reviews">
  <header class="section__header">
    <span class="pill">Neighbour approved</span>
    <h2>See why drivers choose Masonville</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="reviews__grid animate-grid">
    {% from "review-card.njk" import reviewCard %}
    {% for review in reviews.featured %}
      {{ reviewCard(review) }}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section visit" aria-labelledby="visit-heading">
  <div class="visit__grid">
    <div>
      <span class="pill">Plan your visit</span>
      <h2 id="visit-heading">Easy Access, Plenty of Parking</h2>
      <p>Find us just off Dufferin County Road 124. Large lot suitable for trucks and trailers. Swing by for the cheapest gas and a quick refresh.</p>
      <div class="visit__cta">
        <a class="btn" href="{{ store.directionsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Directions</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="tel:{{ store.cta.orderPhone | tel }}">Call {{ store.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="visit__map">
      <iframe title="Map showing Masonville Corner Store" src="https://www.google.com/maps?&amp;q={{ store.address.street | urlencode }}+{{ store.address.city | urlencode }}&amp;output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>